  "problemStatement": "Find the first 4 terms of the Taylor series for f(x) = ln(x) centered at a = 2.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\ln(2) + \\frac{x - 2}{2} - \\frac{(x - 2)^2}{8} + \\frac{(x - 2)^3}{24} - \\dots",
