      "mathExpression": "f(2) = \\ln(2), \\; f'(2) = \\frac{1}{2}, \\; f''(2) = -\\frac{1}{4}, \\; f'''(2) = \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{1}{4}",
      "explanation": "f'(x) = 1/x, f''(x) = -1/x^2, f'''(x) = 2/x^3.",
