      "title": "Divide by Factorials",
      "mathExpression": "c_0 = \\ln(2), \\quad c_1 = \\frac{1}{2}, \\quad c_2 = \\frac{-1/4}{2} = -\\frac{1}{8}, \\quad c_3 = \\frac{1/4}{6} = \\frac{1}{24}",
      "explanation": "Apply c_n = f^(n)(2) / n!.",
      "why": "Taylor coefficients."
    },
